<deck-scene id="s7" title="THE SAME MACHINE, RUNNING US" layout="full">
<div class="finish serif rise">“Nobody has beliefs about gravity.”</div>
<p class="lede rise" style="margin-top:26px">Belief lives where feedback is absent — and that's exactly where a belief can become a badge. Cheap to profess. Expensive to defect from.</p>
