<deck-col><h3>THE MACHINE</h3>
<p><b>EYES</b> — sees tokens</p><p><b>THE MOVE</b> — predicts the next one</p><p><b>THE LOOP</b> — corrects against feedback</p><p><b>THE SCOREBOARD</b> — the benchmark</p><p><b>THE LEDGER</b> — owned by the system</p></deck-col>
<deck-col><h3>THE SAME MACHINE — US</h3>
<p><b>EYES</b> — sees badges</p><p><b>THE MOVE</b> — the narrator talks</p><p><b>THE LOOP</b> — insulated from feedback</p><p><b>THE SCOREBOARD</b> — status</p><p><b>THE LEDGER</b> — usually absent</p></deck-col>
